# Integration test plan

## Scope

Define what is tested in integration **vs** unit **vs** e2e:

- **Unit**: isolated, no real I/O, next to the code (`*.test.<ext>`).
  Not documented here.
- **Integration**: several modules assembled, real I/O against
  local dependencies (ephemeral DB, service mocked at the network
  level, temporary filesystem). This is the scope of this document.
- **E2E**: complete system against real or staging dependencies,
  walking through a user journey. Documented in
  [e2e-tests.md](./e2e-tests.md).

Specify here the boundaries specific to the current project.

